// zzqAI : placeholder CD key for the "zzqai" gamedir.
// Why this file exists: the ui.qvm we load (ioquake3-lineage q3_ui) answers
// UI_HASUNIQUECDKEY = true, i.e. it wants one CD key PER GAMEDIR. With no
// zzqai/q3key present the engine reads an empty key, VerifyCDKey fails and the
// main menu pops the CD key prompt. This file satisfies that check.
// CL_CDKeyValidate(key, NULL) only checks length 16 + characters in
// 237abcdghjlprstw - there is no online validation involved.
// MUST stay a loose file (<Quake3>/zzqai/q3key); packing it into a pk3 does
// nothing, the engine opens it with the OS file API, not the pk3 reader.
// Safe to delete (the prompt will simply come back).
